				<Content name="LinkedSource"><null></null></Content>
				<string name="Name">Instructions</string>
				<ProtectedString name="Source">--1. Hi Noooooo it&apos;s hal0 this is actualy really easy. The first thing you do is ungroup the model Called ungroup and put in lighting
--then put the gui in starter gui(Duh) and boom shop is all setup.

--2. Adding the new weapons: First of all dont add a new sections it&apos;s a pain get me or ploop to do it(I suggest ploop) it&apos;s really that hard
-- in the Currency you put the Leaderstat in this situation you&apos;ld put Money then in Cost you put again no duh the cost then you put the Items exact name
--in ItemName. Then put the gun in lighting.

--Warnings: Most important is you need ploops leaderboard for this shop to function and you may want ploop to check it out for bugs etc.
--Only get me or ploop to edit guns or add new gun sections and thats really it easy huh any questions ask me. 
</ProtectedString>
				<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
			</Properties>
